# Erdős Problem #99 — continuation after exact Kuperberg-rate promotion

Work in one context. Do not delegate to subagents or separate research workers.

## Objective and quantifiers

Obtain a Level I proof or disproof of Erdős Problem #99. The immediate priority is
Target A. A proof must handle every sufficiently large global minimum-diameter
configuration; a disproof requires triangle-free global minimizers for infinitely many
cardinalities.

## Authoritative files

Read, in order:

1. `../README.md`;
2. `../problem/statement.md` and shared theory modules actually used;
3. `../targets/target-a/README.md`;
4. every active Target A module linked there, especially Sections 152–159;
